					<li><strong>Every fact is source-linked.</strong> Permit fees, required documents, utility rules — each one traces to an official government or utility page, not a summary of a summary.</li>
					<li><strong>Every fact is dated.</strong> Guides show when they were last verified, so you know how current the information is.</li>
					<li><strong>We say what we don't know.</strong> A city with incomplete research is marked as limited coverage, not silently filled in.</li>
					<li><strong>After the facts, one clear next step.</strong> Guides link to a real installer marketplace if you're ready to compare quotes — never before you've read the actual permit requirements.</li>
				</ul>
