		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="guides-teaser">
		<div class="guides-teaser-inner">
			<h2>Our deepest coverage: California</h2>
			<p>California is where GridPermit's research goes furthest — 288 published, source-linked solar permit guides across the state, plus rate and battery-payback analysis for the state's major utilities. Every other state has research on file too, with coverage growing city by city.</p>
			<div class="guides-teaser-links">
				<a href="/california/" class="btn-teaser-primary">Read the California Solar Permit Guide →</a>
				<a href="/california/solar-permit-guides/" class="btn-teaser-secondary">Browse verified California cities →</a>
				<a href="/permits" class="btn-teaser-secondary">See coverage in all 50 states →</a>
